This definitely looks worth covering with a regression test. Querying the transfer status before applying the timeout seems like a natural direction, though whether a `DONE` result first observed after the deadline should still count as success is part of the broader timeout semantics here.

If you'd like to contribute the test for this case, that would be very welcome. Otherwise I'll make sure to credit you for identifying it in the PR I'm planning for this.

